WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.723
Zacapa plot, read by a computer voice.

2
00:00:02.973 --> 00:00:09.069
Soil: watch. The satellite saw 1 month of bare soil and 4 with little cover.

3
00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:13.920
Burning: good. No fires seen nearby in 15 years.

4
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:20.896
Midsummer drought: repeats. Dry spells longer than 15 days in 3 of 25 years.

5
00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:24.880
We can't say which option is best: two rain sources disagree.

6
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:29.005
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
